<title>POLAND: Mostostal-K Q1 net inches up to PLN 1 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-K Q1 net inches up to PLN 1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Krakow preliminary results for the first quarter ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1996     Q1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.01   vs    0.96</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 2.47   vs    1.51</p>
<p>    net profit			     1.45   vs    0.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Krakow SA. </p>
<p>    net sales			     31.87   vs   29.02</p>
<p>    costs of sales			29.86   vs   21.29</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.06   vs    0.06</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.05   vs    0.78</p>
<p>    other taxes			     na    vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   2.10   vs    0.64</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.69   vs    0.14</p>
<p>    investment			     0.39   vs    0.22</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
